<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to YourApp!</title>
  <style>
    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      width: 100% !important;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }
    table {
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    .wrapper {
      width: 100%;
      table-layout: fixed;
      background-color: #f8fafc;
      padding: 40px 0;
    }
    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 40px 40px;
    }
    .logo {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #2563eb; /* Vibrant brand blue for the welcome message */
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }
    .title {
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: #0f172a;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      line-height: 1.3;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .text {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #475569;
      margin-top: 0;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }
    /* Quick Steps styling */
    .steps-container {
      margin: 32px 0;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .step-item {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
    }
    .step-number {
      background-color: #eff6ff;
      color: #2563eb;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      width: 24px;
      height: 24px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      text-align: center;
      line-height: 24px;
      margin-right: 12px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .step-text {
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #334155;
    }
    .btn-container {
      margin: 32px 0 16px 0;
    }
    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      background-color: #2563eb;
      color: #ffffff !important;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 600;
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 14px 36px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px -1px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
    }
    .divider {
      border: 0;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      margin: 32px 0 24px 0;
    }
    .footer-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin: 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <table class="wrapper" width="100%" role="presentation">
    <tr>
      <td align="center">
        <table class="container" role="presentation">
          <tr>
            <td class="content">
              
              <div class="logo">YourApp</div>

              <h1 class="title">Welcome aboard, {{username}}! 👋</h1>
              
              <p class="text">
                We're absolutely thrilled to have you here. Your account is fully set up and ready to rock. Here are a few quick tips to help you get the absolute most out of your dashboard right out of the gate:
              </p>

              <!-- Guided Next Steps -->
              <ul class="steps-container">
                <li class="step-item">
                  <div class="step-number">1</div>
                  <div class="step-text"><strong>Complete your profile:</strong> Upload an avatar and add your details to customize your workspace.</div>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item">
                  <div class="step-number">2</div>
                  <div class="step-text"><strong>Explore the dashboard:</strong> Check out your main feed to see real-time updates and analytics.</div>
                </li>
                <li class="step-item">
                  <div class="step-number">3</div>
                  <div class="step-text"><strong>Invite team members:</strong> Collaboration is seamless—bring in your peers directly from the settings panel.</div>
                </li>
              </ul>

              <!-- Big Call to Action -->
              <table class="btn-container" role="presentation">
                <tr>
                  <td>
                    <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="btn" target="_blank">Go to Dashboard</a>
                  </td>
                </tr>
              </table>

              <p class="text" style="margin-top: 24px;">
                Have questions or hit a roadblock? Just hit reply to this email—our customer support team is always hanging out here to help you get sorted.
              </p>

              <p class="text" style="margin-bottom: 0;">
                Cheers,<br>
                <strong>The YourApp Team</strong>
              </p>

              <hr class="divider">

              <p class="footer-text">
                You are receiving this email because you created an account on YourApp.<br>
                &copy; {{year}} YourApp. All rights reserved.
              </p>

            </td>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

</body>
</html>